.Sh HISTORY
A
.Nm
utility appeared in
.Fx 2.2 .
This implementation was written for OxideBSD; it reads
.Xr usermgmt.conf 5
in place of
.Fx Ns 's
.Pa pw.conf ,
and has no
.Fl D ,
.Fl R
or
.Fl w Cm yes .
